Theme provenance
----------------
The .rstheme files under themes/ and theme-support/ are modified versions of
Tomorrow Night Bright shipped with RStudio 2026.09.0+174.
Upstream: https://github.com/rstudio/rstudio
Original theme: src/cpp/session/resources/themes/tomorrow_night_bright.rstheme
Matching RStudio source revision: 870df5ed7859c758db7aed6f510a3edca3c74bd7
Source: https://github.com/rstudio/rstudio/blob/870df5ed7859c758db7aed6f510a3edca3c74bd7/src/cpp/session/resources/themes/tomorrow_night_bright.rstheme
RStudio copyright: Posit Software, PBC; distributed under AGPL version 3.
The modifications change colors and add IDE surface selectors. They do not
include the RStudio application or any compiled application resources.

The experimental patch under theme-support/ targets RStudio source revision
9c11fb25c2a24c4faa09f79befb1907dc8a825de. It is an unmerged community proposal.
It contains source changes, theme documentation, and an end-to-end test.

Compatibility tools
-------------------
fix-codex-hook.mjs and check-codex-hooks.mjs describe and verify a local
compatibility change for Posit Assistant 1.8.0 with Codex 0.154.0 on Windows.
Small exact-match strings identify the installed adapter. No complete Posit
Assistant bundle, engine binary, credentials, or vendor license is included.
Those applications remain subject to their own licenses and service terms.

